436 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Constitution score increases by 2\054 and your Strength score increases by 1\056\nAge\056 The Ogerem push their young to achieve tasks beyond their means\054 forcing them to reach maturity around age 12\054 at least in the eyes of Ogerem society\056 While some Ogerem have lived to be over 200 years old\054 the average lifespan of an Ogerem is often no more than 125 years\056\nAlignment\056 Ogerem temperament usually sways towards good\073 however\054 this often proves difficult to achieve with the Ogerem\047s horrific appearance\056 Ogerem often follow a code of honor\054 whether set by their clan or by themselves\056\nSize\056 Ogerem stand between 7 and 8 feet tall and weigh between 280 and 340 pounds\056 Your size is Medium\056\nSpeed\056 Your base walking speed is 30 feet\056\nDarkvision\056 You can see in dim light within 60 feet of you as if it were bright light\054 and in darkness as if it were dim light\056 You can\047t discern color in darkness\054 only shades of gray\056\nLanguages\056 You can speak\054 read and write Common and Giant\056\nNoxious Presence\056 As a bonus action\054 you release a foul\054 overwhelming odor from your skin and breath\056 Each creature within 10 feet of you must make a Constitution saving throw \050DC \075 8 \053 your proficiency bonus \053 your Constitution modifier\051\056 On a failed save\054 a creature is poisoned until the end of your next turn\056 Creatures that don\047t need to breathe or are immune to poison automatically succeed on this save\056 Once you use this feature\054 you can\031t use it again until you finish a long rest\056\nPowerful Build\056 You count as one size larger when determining your carrying capacity and the weight you can push\054 drag\054 or lift\056\nThick Skin\056 You have advantage on saving throws against disease and poison\054 and you have resistance to poison damage\056\nSturdy\056 Your sheer bulk makes you difficult to move against your will\056 You have advantage on saving throws and ability checks against being knocked prone or moved forcibly\056\nGiant Diet\056 You require twice as much food and drink per day as a standard Medium creature to avoid the effects of exhaustion from starvation\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 437 0 R
     /Pg 430 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

